  "2026-10-20T08:13:14.469Z","harness:codex","Token-budget review: kept the 32-surface hard token-budget ceilings unchanged. Compact brief JSON saves whitespace without dropping any semantic fields; accounting independently validates compact or pretty JSON and rejects other encodings. The deterministic agent-task replay now costs 13676 tokens across the unchanged transcript versus 13795 previously: the four-read orientation falls 2325 -> 2139 while triage rises 552 -> 619 because it now carries all four effective comparator stages. Approved baseline regeneration records that specific information tradeoff; transcript digest, required facts, orientation winner (1087), refusal comparisons, negative controls and per-step regression checks remain enforced."
