  "2026-10-20T08:28:18.176Z","harness:codex","Hosted first-head smoke caught a stale dogfood list-open four-field expectation. Updated both the real package-first acceptance assertion and its independent mocked driver to require priority. The focused dogfood driver suite passes; the real workflow is being rerun before full coverage. Static semantic/contract/token/SDK gates pass up to transport-floor performance: first qualified control measured get best 393ms > 362ms; unchanged isolated rerun had control median 115ms >106ms (unqualified) and preserves an unverified verdict. No ceiling or qualification rule was relaxed. CodSpeed first-head report also flags an unchanged createQueryFingerprint benchmark (-1.42%) with differing runtime environments; exact revised-head report must be triaged."
